Cell["\<\
When the pairing on cohomology is perfect, every harmonic subspace admits \
such a coexact part (arXiv:2004.07362, Lemma 4.3).\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"854347de-e2ca-40ca-8494-75a4a448b9e8"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Otherwise a harmonic class can pair nontrivially with an element that is \
not closed. The result is then a ",
